&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OFqqAFxrF_8Q7kNvwEmaz-_&_nc_oc=AdoqR1CBd7Z7pnG33aT9yc8jA4iP5Qv7x-ncVEtOyI3sjAmB1PIIQEg46NC5G71JRQw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3kL6QHozdEiRWDGiWJW8XOucvfJCQodRQO21_EpPfSdg&oe=69EB735C"}, {"file_name": "RR_v2_SS6.png", "id": "1295553582490750", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620444_1295553585824083_5096553140316751332_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v8KbNuQhYYYQ7kNvwH80l1u&_nc_oc=Ado1lAL0h0riYhFxA88wbczNv_LYUMBpE7nMtO1bb-rcY89cpZOtXIBX8bBttaKPpi8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1KGZ3wImwGQwc3VIdLFZ3pOR8V65ZW3MvjeKpWU9ap8w&oe=69EB5FA2"}, {"file_name": "RR_v2_SS4.png", "id": "1170881771700118", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620444_1170881775033451_2871286342883947345_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jLUJyBrsKoAQ7kNvwFknpjr&_nc_oc=AdrmXjyrB0IkMcxf5jCCPbeU5lE1umj9nP1ZulqRTL936PHBdW8dMWMp2tn15YFXMXc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2DZ7UceOeLySf502LO0BYoiv4SfCgGZ6xLZ8IcxeK-3Q&oe=69EB67A2"}, {"file_name": "RR_v2_SS7.png", "id": "1573537577091711", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618937_1573537580425044_1574709008314021246_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TnzBs3DDTp8Q7kNvwGLdfOo&_nc_oc=AdpR0ja5zg-z9QDNY5GuAmKYu0akA-tQRk6yp_qLriWU1spELe79tPMFGHaaJr5pSVo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af35SbBxOMtuOP0D5amqIanC-6594fBc7gx_eSGxkez1Kg&oe=69EB78F6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rally Racing VR: Xtreme Speed Challenge", "keywords": ["Racing", "Speed", "Rally", "Offroad", "Dirt"], "long_description": "Rally Racing VR: Xtreme Speed Challenge delivers an intense rally racing experience built for VR. The game\u2019s standout feature is its intuitive VR car controller, allowing natural steering & smooth handling that responds instantly to your movements. This realistic control system gives you strong sense of speed & true rally immersion\n\nRealistic Car Physics & Interior\n\nAuthentic rally physics bring believable vehicle reactions on dirt, gravel, & rugged terrain. The detailed interior, stylish steering wheel, & digital speedometer enhance the feeling of acceleration and control.\n\nBeautiful & Dynamic Environments\n\nRace through long, visually rich environments including forests, offroad, & mountains. Each track supports day & night driving & multiple weather conditions, offering variety, atmosphere, & a deeper sense of adventure. Cheering crowds react as you race, adding energy to every stage\n\nExotic & Customizable Cars\n\nChoose from multiple exotic cars, each with unique performance & visuals. Customize your vehicles with textures, & skins to create your own racing style. Every car feels distinct in both handling & appearance\n\nRally Challenges & High-Speed Action\n\nCompete through checkpoints, technical rally routes, and rugged offroad paths. When you need a burst of speed, activate Nitro Boost to power through straightaways & gain an edge in intense moments\n\nStart the engine, feel the control in your hands, & experience rally racing the way it\u2019s meant to be fast, immersive, & real.\n", "short_description": "Rally Racing VR: Xtreme Speed Challenge delivers immersive speed with a highly responsive VR car controller that makes every turn feel natural & precise. Race through long, detailed environments across forests, mountains, & canyon routes, each enhanced with day night lighting & dynamic weather. Experience realistic interiors, a digital speedometer, & smooth car handling that reacts authentically to terrain. Choose from customizable cars & enjoy fast offroad racing built for true VR immersion."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gamotronixstudio/privacypolicy-meta", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_na