 improved car sounds (engine, backfire, turbo, gear shifts, braking)\n\u2022 Major graphics improvements with Low / Medium / High settings added to Options\n\u2022 Rotating tires and improved car exterior visuals during gameplay\n\u2022 Crowd ambience added to all tracks\n\u2022 Improved car health system and minimap checkpoints\n\u2022 Runtime memory optimization and performance improvements\n\u2022 Many bugs fixed", "created_date": 1773666280, "id": "26408798218744322", "version": "1.0.4", "version_code": 4, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25551274277830058", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26408798218744322"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "869166452430702"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1768579537, "id": "25861867143437435", "version": "0.0.3", "version_code": 3, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25551274277830058", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26408798218744322"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "869166452430702"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1767112137, "id": "25722325997391551", "version": "0.0.2", "version_code": 2, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results